# choice.pdl - the "Show Choices" popup of the helm event (owner 2026-10-24: a yes / no popup before taking the controls, for the visual factor, not a standard). Enter next to the console asks this; Yes plays the event page, No closes the popup. Delete this file and Enter plays the page at once.
# CHOICE | title | question | yes label | no label
CHOICE | HELM | Take the helm? | Yes - fly the ship | No - stay here
